<title>RUSSIA: Russian Jan-Mar vehicle output rises 11 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russian Jan-Mar vehicle output rises 11 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia boosted overall vehicle production by 11 percent in the first three months of this year compared to year-ago levels, State Statistics Committee figures showed.</p>
<p> RUSSIAN VEHICLE OUTPUT	   Jan-Mar'97 Jan-Feb'97 Jan-Mar'96</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change all vehicles  +11	  +12	  -14</p>
<p> total production autos	   224,000    146,000    n/a</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change autos	   +16	  +16	  -6</p>
<p> total production trucks	  33,200     21,000     n/a</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change trucks	  -3	   -7	   -26</p>
<p> total production buses	   9,500	6,000	n/a</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change buses	   +3	   +2	   -27</p>
<p>--Andrei Khalip, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
